      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This is a case report of a 22 year old female who presented to the emergency department with abdominal pain following ovulation induction for the purpose of transvaginal harvesting of the ovum. This article depicts the ultrasound findings in Ovarian Hyperstimulation Syndrome, a common complication of ovulation induction."},
